			"notes": "New: sneaking during a grapple lets go of the chain — your momentum is cut and you drop. Works mid-flight on block grapples and while riding a projectile grapple; letting go also disarms the pending bounce dash. Sneaking while firing doesn't cancel — the release only arms once you release sneak. For Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric); requires Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin."
		},
