			"notes": "Fixed: the 2-quick-uses-then-20s charge system now covers ALL Hell's Mace chain uses — block grapple, projectile grapple and enemy pull share one pool (previously only the pull was charged, so quick double-grapples never worked). New config keys chain_charges/chain_cooldown/chain_recharge replace the old pull_*/grapple_cooldown keys, so stale saved configs no longer interfere. Heaven's Sword texture: the gold energy groove now runs up to just below the tip and connects properly across the guard, in all three animation frames. For Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric); requires Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin."
		},
