			"notes": "Kits are now auto-generated from every registered armor set — including addon sets: /hha kit <set> (tab completion; addon sets as <addonid>.<path>) equips fully enchanted armor, the set weapons by role convention (first = sword enchants, second = mace enchants) and the standard SMP loadout. New /hha addons command lists loaded addons with everything they registered. For Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric); requires Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin."
		},
