			"notes": "Fixed: Fire Camp no longer vanishes while Brutes are alive — camp and Brutes now last 10 minutes, and the camp only reverts when all its Brutes are dead (unloaded chunks no longer count as dead). Hell's Mace chain charges now refill fully 20s after the last use, so single pulls don't eat into the next fight's charges. New ability-matched HUD icons: expanding light wave for Heaven's Sword, redrawn Heaven's Mace and lava beam. Allied Brutes' Sharpness V axe shows its glint again. For Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric); requires Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin."
		},
