			"notes": "Complete addon API: six generic ability keybinds (Ability 1-6 — 1-3 keep G/H/U for beam, Fire Camp and Ultra; 4-6 start unbound and are free for addons), the ability model is now explicitly 'ability key -> equipment check -> function' with per-ability faction gates, and a new lore API lets addons register dynamic tooltips showing live config values just like the built-in items. /hha list groups addon settings per addon. Note: keybind IDs were renamed, so custom G/H/U rebinds reset once. For Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric); requires Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin."
